menu "boxsim"

config BOXSIM_DEBUGCON
    bool "The debug console"
    default y
    help
        debugcon.h's console, on the link the firmware logs on: the screen,
        the audio and the inputs, from the desktop with tools/boxctl.py.
        Off, debugcon_start does nothing and the console isn't built in.

endmenu
